ual_config] to [code]true[/code].\n \t\tFor physical simulation, [SpringBoneSimulator3D] can have children as self-standing collisions that are not related to [PhysicsServer3D], see also [SpringBoneCollision3D].\n+\t\t[b]Warning:[/b] A scaled [SpringBoneSimulator3D] will likely not behave as expected. Make sure that the parent [Skeleton3D] and its bones are not scaling as well.","path":"doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml","commit_id":"48e74af421cc36819c567753f13f3c0f79b564a5","original_commit_id":"dac61730bdfa6af52bbfaf9cf0edc7095c453afc","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Same here","created_at":"2025-01-15T08:54:36Z","updated_at":"2025-01-15T08:56:59Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101571#discussion_r1916169415","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101571","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1916169415"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101571#discussion_r1916169415"}